{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Advantage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "优势"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear purpose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空目的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't insert the roll. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插入失败，请重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DC": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "DND Dice": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Dice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disadvantage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "劣势"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone in the chat needs DND Dice to see the result; others only see the formula and an install prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群里每个人都要安装 DND Dice 才能看到结果；没装的人只会看到公式和安装提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modifier": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Normal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "普通"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once sent, the bubble shows the result, the same for everyone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点发送后，气泡上直接显示结果，大家看到的都一样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Messages and go to a conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开「信息」，进入一个对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your dice, then tap Roll": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选好骰子，点「投掷」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purpose (optional), e.g. Perception check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目的（可选），如：察觉检定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roll": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "投掷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roll Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再投一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roll in the App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 App 里投骰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set your dice and tap Roll; the roll goes into the text field": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置骰子后点「投掷」，消息会放进输入框"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set your dice on this screen and tap Roll. The result shows at the top; the last 10 rolls are kept until you close the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本页设好骰子，点「投掷」，结果显示在上方；最近 10 次记录关掉 App 后清空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + next to the text field and choose DND Dice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点输入框左侧的 +，在 App 列表里选「DND Dice」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result is fixed when you tap Roll and nobody sees it before it's sent, so deleting and rolling again doesn't help.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果在点「投掷」时就已确定，发送前谁都看不到，删掉重投也不会更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To say what the roll is for (like “attack the goblin”), type it at the top of the panel; it shows in the bubble": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在面板最上方写这次投骰的目的（如「攻击哥布林」），会显示在气泡里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use in Messages": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「信息」里使用"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
